WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.242
The project asks you to design a small analytics layer for three different needs.

00:00:05.242 --> 00:00:10.952
Employee performance is stable shared logic, so a standard view makes sense.

00:00:10.952 --> 00:00:19.452
Recent customer activity can also be a reusable view, while a specific inactivity threshold can stay in a common table

00:00:19.452 --> 00:00:23.517
expression because different reports may use different thresholds.

00:00:23.517 --> 00:00:31.602
The diagnosis dashboard uses a repeatedly requested summary, so a materialized view can make sense when a known refresh

00:00:31.602 --> 00:00:32.865
delay is acceptable.
